# Internal Layoff Discussions - Leaked Screenshots

## Overview
The following screenshots were leaked from internal discussions at HugeSmoothTech regarding potential layoffs. These discussions have sparked significant concern among employees, who are already grappling with anxiety over the company's ongoing AI-first strategy and its implications for workforce stability. Below is a detailed breakdown of the content of the screenshots, organized by key themes and individuals involved.

